#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<AccordionItem title=\"**Observable estimation**\">\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"These tutorials focus on estimating physically meaningful quantities, such "
"as energy or correlation values, by preparing quantum states and measuring "
"observables. Techniques include both variational and Trotterized circuit "
"approaches that balance circuit expressiveness with circuit-depth "
"efficiency. Emphasis is placed on workflows that reduce quantum resource "
"demands while maintaining accuracy, and enabling practical estimation of "
"observables in chemical and physical systems.\n"
msgstr ""

